                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Site latitude in decimal degrees (north positive). With a site, the browser lists the nearest stations first, every row states its distance, and the map shows both. Optional, and only as a pair with Longitude: a lone latitude is not a site. Left empty, the document's Earth Anchor Point is the site when one is set; otherwise the catalog is listed in publisher order.</item>
