                  <items count="4">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A road as a CNOSSOS-EU line source: its centreline, a daily traffic total, the heavy-vehicle share and a speed. One item per curve, or one value for all of them. Feed the sources to Noise Run.

The daily total is split 70/20/10 % over day (07-19), evening (19-23) and night (23-07), and heavies half-and-half between two-axle and multi-axle trucks — the neutral defaults when a count says no more.

Version 1.19.0.827</item>
